sequenceDiagram
  participant Spec as Test spec
  participant Fix as testFixtures
  participant Login as LoginPage
  participant Home as HomePage
  participant CFG as env and paths
  participant PW as Playwright
  participant App as MediShop app

  Spec->>Fix: import test expect
  Fix->>Login: create loginPage from page
  Spec->>Login: goTo
  Login->>CFG: paths.login
  Login->>PW: goto baseURL plus login
  PW->>App: open login screen
  Spec->>Login: loginAs user pass
  Login->>App: fill and submit
  Login->>Home: return HomePage
  Spec->>Spec: expect URL and nav visible
  PW->>PW: video screenshot on rules
  PW->>Spec: pass or fail
